{"text":"And in an instant, their entire self-image is completely shattered. In an instant, the way they view themselves has completely changed, turned on its head. And so what you find is that there's an entire generation growing up with lower self-esteem than previous generations. Remember, they have grown up in an Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat world, in which they are very, very good at putting filters on everything. They're very, very good at curating how they want to be seen. And we think they're full of confidence. They seem to have all the answers. They seem to be telling us what to do. At the end of the day, it's just not there. It's just not true. It's just not true. Their confidence is a lot weaker than before. They don't know where they're coming from. They don't know where they're going. They're unsure of themselves, and they lack the courage to ask. We say things like, my door is always open, assuming that they have the courage to walk through the door.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.52,"end":0.96},{"text":"in","start":0.96,"end":1.06},{"text":"an","start":1.06,"end":1.18},{"text":"instant","start":1.18,"end":1.52,"punct":","},{"text":"their","start":1.7,"end":1.78},{"text":"entire","start":1.78,"end":2.1},{"text":"self-image","start":2.1,"end":2.62},{"text":"is","start":2.62,"end":3.24},{"text":"completely","start":3.24,"end":3.58},{"text":"shattered","start":3.58,"end":4.0,"punct":"."},{"text":"In","start":4.86,"end":4.88},{"text":"an","start":4.88,"end":4.98},{"text":"instant","start":4.98,"end":5.24,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":5.38,"end":5.44},{"text":"way","start":5.44,"end":5.58},{"text":"they","start":5.58,"end":5.72},{"text":"view","start":5.72,"end":5.9},{"text":"themselves","start":5.9,"end":6.24},{"text":"has","start":6.24,"end":6.44},{"text":"completely","start":6.44,"end":6.78},{"text":"changed","start":6.78,"end":7.12,"punct":","},{"text":"turned","start":7.3,"end":7.46},{"text":"on","start":7.46,"end":7.68},{"text":"its","start"